ns.  \nJasmine Castillo\nStudent Support \nCoordinator for Native \nAmerican Students\nValerie Sampson\nDonor Events \nCoord.\nBrenda Chiprez\nIT Support Technician\nCarlos Capetillo\nDirector of Retention\nJulia Polk\nAssistant Fin Aid Dir.\nNancy Benavides\nProject Coordinator\nRenae Harris\nPresident’s Liaison for \nNative Affairs\nJulia Polk"
